let __v_182 = Value::from("Then it is the seat rather than the washer. Take the head off again and look at the brass ring the washer presses on: if it is pitted or scored it can be re-ground with a seat tool, and if the tap turns a quarter turn it has a ceramic cartridge instead, which is replaced whole and matched by the maker's name stamped on the tap. A cartridge is a ten-minute swap and stops it for good; until then, turn the water off at the isolating valve when you leave the house.");
